# Follow `source`d files so cross-file references check for real instead of
# reporting SC2154 on every variable a script inherits from a library
# (observability.test.sh sources observability.sh; setup.sh sources
# lib/links.sh). Only takes effect from this file — the directive is not
# accepted inline. SCRIPTDIR lets `# shellcheck source=<name>` resolve
# relative to the script wherever shellcheck is invoked from.
external-sources=true
source-path=SCRIPTDIR
